{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, move and grab it. Check object properties, do specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectproperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
    "BT": {
